    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Kol Korran is the neutral deity of trade.<br /><strong>Areas of Concern</strong> Wealth, money, trade, commerce, theft<br /><strong>Alignment</strong> N<br /><strong>Divine Font</strong> Heal or Harm<br /><strong>Divine Ability</strong> Wisdom or Charisma<br /><strong>Divine Skill</strong> Society<br /><strong>Domains</strong> Ambition, Cities, Travel, Wealth<br /><strong>Cleric Spells</strong> 1st: shattering gem, 4th: creation, 7th: magnificent mansion<br /><strong>Edicts</strong> Gather new wealth, count your riches, open up new trade routes, discover and retrieve items of great worth.<br /><strong>Anathema</strong> Allow those who steal from you to go unpunished, forgo simple opportunities to gain riches.<br /><strong>Favoured Weapon</strong> Mace</p>"
    },
